<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN GRASS-COURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HALLE, Germany 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results at</p>
<p>the $875,000 German grass-court men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Hendrik Dreekmann (Germany) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Thomas Haas (Germany) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>8-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Nicolas Escude (France) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
